- Check if icmp[0] == 8 && icmp[1] == 0 (Echo Request)
- Swap eth->h_source and eth->h_dest
- Swap ip->saddr and ip->daddr
- Change icmp[0] = 0 (Echo Reply)
- Update ICMP checksum (icmp_csum = icmp_csum + bpf_htons(0x0800) with carry wrap or recompute)
- Return XDP_TX for Echo Requests, XDP_PASS for everything else
- GPL license and SEC("xdp") entry point

